          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "火车 (huǒchē) is built from 火 (huǒ) 'fire' and 车 'vehicle', both inherited from Middle Chinese, xwaX and tsyhae (Guangyun, in Baxter's transcription): a fire carriage, from the days of steam."
            }
